From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devin <devin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:30:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix singular exiled-card placement

Lower singular a/an card-exiled-this-way placement to an up-to-one
tracked-exile choice followed by a single-object move. Keep mandatory
wording exact-one, make optional decline a no-op, and bind the Haste and
delayed-return continuation to the chosen object. Handle the choice/move
structure without relying on a sibling clause; leave plural wording alone.

